/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/list.k:60:  rule <k> Compare(LV:Val, CmpOp("not in", list(VS:ValSeq))) => #memberAcc(LV, list(VS)) ~> #notB ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-61-  rule <k> #memberAcc(V:Val, IT:Iterable) => #iterNext(IT) ~> #memberCont(V) ... </k>
