/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-53-  rule isMutMethod(M:String)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-54-    => M ==String "append" orBool M ==String "sort" orBool M ==String "extend"
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-55-       orBool M ==String "insert" orBool M ==String "pop" orBool M ==String "remove"
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:56:  rule <k> #applyK(toCall(boundMethodV(ref(H:Int), M:String)), ACC:Vals)
